{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":28323,\"title\":\"I Will Fight No More Forever\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Pursued by 2,000 US soldiers and cavalry, Chief Joseph leads his tribe of 800 Nez Perce on a 1,700 mile journey across the West and towards Canada. Based on the true story of the westward expansion of the United States and the military force used to displace Native Americans from their lands.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/aVyczg4Q8C7RBctk17eY8HmqBNy.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9V9jxmDbUZFPfgfzjKVMVL1FllV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"voteCount\":11,\"year\":1975,\"runtime\":106,\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Drama\",\"Western\",\"War\",\"TV Movie\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Richard T. Heffron\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":35525,\"name\":\"Richard T. Heffron\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lxiGD7tVWOYUfacm0LxJuJaplFX.jpg\"},{\"id\":6577,\"name\":\"James Whitmore\",\"character\":\"General Oliver O. Howard\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nYMAbkfwFIgKK84vnLoQctI6vHg.jpg\"},{\"id\":100418,\"name\":\"Ned Romero\",\"character\":\"Chief Joseph\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wOc4DcHbusBcpy7NAmJMAqZb5Mi.jpg\"},{\"id\":16431,\"name\":\"Sam Elliott\",\"character\":\"Captain Wood\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zE1fpXlIUo7fcujlVlGvHdDiCv6.jpg\"},{\"id\":161149,\"name\":\"Linda Redfearn\",\"character\":\"Toma\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":161147,\"name\":\"Emilio Delgado\",\"character\":\"Ollokot\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rKNkINNfOAvLlzrdkxgVjzTjOGY.jpg\"},{\"id\":3020098,\"name\":\"John Kauffman\",\"character\":\"Wahlitits\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1197424,\"name\":\"Nick Ramus\",\"character\":\"Rainbow\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":92903,\"name\":\"Frank Salsedo\",\"character\":\"White Bird\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2HoTBejS2oZVQrVcuKyXIoNDvmp.jpg\"},{\"id\":2616407,\"name\":\"Vincent St. Cyr\",\"character\":\"Chief Looking Glass\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3481965,\"name\":\"Charles Ynfante\",\"character\":\"Yellow Wolf\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":57153,\"name\":\"Conrad Hool\",\"character\":\"Lieutenant\",\"photo\":null}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":21461,\"title\":\"Lage Raho Munna Bhai\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lgSn1tXDstMXSHJYkSibKkHqW8y.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/urxONLFFBKFWzsxLcvUaRgo4v4M.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Lovable goon Munna falls for a morning radio host by the name of Jahnvi, who also runs an elders' home which an unscrupulous builder seeks to attain. In order to gain Jahnvi’s attention, he cheats his way to winning a Mahatma Gandhi radio quiz. When Jahnvi consequently expresses interest in Munna, he and his best friend Circuit attempt to keep up the facade.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"Romance\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":26428,\"title\":\"Agora\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1xsFa6I5vDd2UI1AJ1tsW7BUChv.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bdms9QMM4y6NBKIvXDINsKnK0Fj.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2009,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A historical drama set in Roman Egypt, concerning philosopher Hypatia of Alexandria and her relationship with her slave Davus, who is torn between his love for her and the possibility of gaining his freedom by joining the rising tide of Christianity.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":478820,\"title\":\"The Emperor of Paris\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7mZBfj3dFIzQgMVfkDwi9u4JBxI.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8y8qWIV6Yi5kF2wUsegbqys7X8t.jpg\",\"rating\":6.3,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Paris, France, early 19th century. The legendary convict François Vidocq lives in disguise trying to escape from a tragic past that torments him. When, after an unfortunate event, he crosses paths with the police chief, he makes a bold decision that will turn the ruthless mastermind of the Parisian underworld against him.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Crime\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":25533,\"title\":\"Undead or Alive: A Zombedy\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xH4WnW0QVOYIePdM1hmN9aiLV9j.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fQ94z5yMIlpHHS5GgnS8zK6oryd.jpg\",\"rating\":5.3,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Elmer Winslow is a soldier on the run from the Union Army, and Luke Budd is a cowboy with a broken heart. When the two misfits rob the corrupt sheriff of an old west town, they have no idea that a plague of zombies is sweeping the country, or that Geronimo's sexy niece may be their only hope of survival.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Western\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":22842,\"title\":\"Black Cloud\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/f4A0N9ESstu4ZhkGxwNFsLtVy7d.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uLdG0vAYxNPUhLhhteeMQcwKEVo.jpg\",\"rating\":4.3,\"year\":2004,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Black Cloud, is an inspirational story about a young Navajo, Native American boxer, who overcomes personal challenges as he comes to terms with his heritage, while fighting his way for a spot on the US Olympic boxing team.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":866716,\"title\":\"When Shadows Dance at Night\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/p3qpTngExtaq8O5XlYjQ6Buibcn.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zxBxvlT2wIRGJXNd9uYaPCeX8zR.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Following her brother's death, Georgia, a young college student, returns home to her reservation only to find she's become the prey of a shapeshifting, faceless figure.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Horror\",\"Fanta